1628
00:58:47.230 --> 00:58:47.930
So good.

1629
00:58:48.290 --> 00:58:48.890
So good.

1630
00:58:49.070 --> 00:58:50.090
Aw, that's health care, guys.

1631
00:58:50.090 --> 00:58:51.150
That is health care.

